The reported importance of 1-Methyladenosine, Guanidine acetic acid, C18-Carnitine, and Hypoxanthine is also used as proof of the model's strength. Importantly, altered concentrations of 1-Methyladenosine have been commonly reported in gastrointestinal cancer [
95
